From 89c3601f402b6b5d6f02a1bde85be2244dc2e5fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keke142 <jdkeke142@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 16:04:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Implement cursor-shape-v1 protocol

Let the compositor render standard cursors instead of the client
uploading cursor pixmaps. This ensures the cursor theme, size and
color rendering are consistent between the application window and
the rest of the desktop.

Requires compositor support (KDE 5.x+, GNOME 46+, most wlroots-based).

Based on glfw/glfw PR #2679 by JakobDev.
---
